  <p>1- Bhala kab tak yunhi pyasi rahogi utho zid chhodo,<br> Chach ka wasta deti hun ye faqa abhi todo,<br> Isi pani ke khatir khoon me ammu nahaya hai..!!<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
