  <p>3- Najane saara din maqtal me kya guzri hai pyase per,<br> Lo kuch pani chhidak aao ali asgher ke lashe per,<br> Zara se sin me usne pyas ka sadma uthaya hai..!!<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
  <p>4- Labon ko tishnagi ki teer se azaad ker beti,<br> Na ab is derja ro ro ker chacha ko yaad ker beti,<br> Ghubar-e-tashnagi kab se tere chehre pe chhaya hai..!!<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
  <p>5- Suna jis dam sakeena ne phuphi se naam pani ka,<br> Khayal aane laga reh reh ke ammu ki jawani ka,<br> Ye keh ker khoon-e-dil aankho se bacchi ne bahaya hai..!!<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
  <p>6- Kaleja phhatt gaya nanhi si jaan ka shiddate gham se,<br> Lipat ke der tak kehti rahi ammu ke parcham se,<br> Piyungi haath se uske jise saqqa banaya hai..!!<br> Ye pani kaun laaya hai, ye pani kaun laaya hai..</p> 
