  <p>8- Dua merne ki mere keejiye shah-e-madina se,<br> Ye paani kis tarah utrega halqe sakeena se,<br> Phuphi amma isi paani ne ammu se chhudaya hai,<br> Ye paani kaun laaya hai, ye paani kaun laaya hai<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
  <p>9- Jaza-e-khair de usko khuda itni dua ker do,<br> Utho kuch shukriya to hur ki bewa ka ada kar do,<br> Hamara aalam-e-ghurbat me usne dil badhaya hai..!!<br> Sakeena pani aaya hai *4</p> 
